  "private": true,
  "description": "Next.js 15 (App Router, TypeScript strict) dashboard app for LLM-Telemetry. Migration scaffold (T-0, LST-281) per docs/plans/node-nextjs-migration.md §4; the Python dashboard keeps serving :8477 until cutover (plan §12).",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=24"
